## 2026-08-13 Update – Flesh out 0.001 operational data model

- Summary: Specified and implemented the MVP DynamoDB single-table contract plus shared TypeScript key/normalization library.
- Branch: `0.001-operational-data-model`
- Files changed:
  - `specs/0/0.001-operational-data-model/*` (spec, plan, data-model, research, tasks, notes, manualtester)
  - `packages/data-model/**` (types, normalize, keys, vitest)
- Decisions:
  - Single table `webnotary`; keys `HOST#/CERT#`, `CERT#/META`, `VERIFY#/PENDING`
  - No GSI in MVP
  - Pending TTL default 900s with `attribute_not_exists(pk)`
  - Stored status enum richer than public API; client fields separated from observer fields
  - Fingerprints: lowercase hex SHA-256; hostnames: IDNA/punycode lowercased; no IP literals
- Tests executed: `cd packages/data-model && npm test` → 14/14 passed; `npm run build` succeeded
- Follow-up work: human review; commit/PR when requested; then 0.002 can provision from `data-model.md`

