## 2026-08-13 Update – Implement 0.007 CT gate and trust policy

- Summary: Locked D1–D6; shipped `@webnotary/trust-policy` and wired lookup `/v1/check` with inventory gate, sibling CONFLICT, and CT_SEEN stamp.
