  - Clean host + garbage FP → `unknown`, no pending.
  - Inventory FP + clean host → `unknown`, pending + `CT_SEEN`.
  - `example.com` + non-observed FP → `conflict`; known observed FP → `valid`.
- Follow-up: PR when requested; then 0.008 Chrome extension.

